' diagrams/after.puml — the same view of your FINAL code. It must show rooms, booking, filter
' and the UI (App and any components), with an arrow for each import. Replace this stub.
'
@startuml
title SIS #04 - After Refactoring

component "main.tsx" as Main
component "App.tsx\nUI" as App
component "rooms.ts\nRoom + ROOMS" as Rooms
component "filter.ts\nfilterRooms()" as Filter
component "booking.ts\ncanBook() + checkRoom()" as Booking
component "bookingLogic.ts\npresentation helpers" as BookingLogic
component "types.ts\nUI result types" as Types

Main --> App : renders

App --> Rooms : reads ROOMS
App --> Filter : calls filterRooms()
App --> Booking : calls checkRoom()
App --> BookingLogic : time formatting,\nuser-facing reason
App --> Types : CheckResult

Filter --> Rooms : Room type
Booking --> Rooms : Room type

note right of Rooms
Each room owns:
- capacity
- equipment
- blocked status
- bookings
end note

note right of Booking
canBook keeps AC1-AC5
checkRoom selects one room
and uses that room's data
end note

@enduml